## 2. If… then pathways

| If… | Then… |
|-----|--------|
| You only want to browse | Open Play as **Guest** — no email required |
| You want Ask / Journal / member seats | **Register Free** — email + handle, $0, no card |
| You want weekly Office Hours reminders | Leave **Office Hours** checked on register (or add later via `?plan=oh-attend`) |
| You want a 20-minute consult | Leave **Consult** checked → after join, open Play → **Book** and pick a slot |
| You hit freemium caps | Upgrade on register to Freemium / Standard / Pro / Ultra (Square card) |
| You need a pass-token login | That is issued by app identity rails **after** Free join when enabled — not on the $0 store page |

