## 4. Join Free (email + handle)

1. Open {{REGISTER_URL}}?plan=free  
2. Confirm **Free** (or Community Member alias) is checked.  
3. Enter **Email** and **Handle** (3–32 chars; suggestions if taken).  
4. Optionally keep **Office Hours** / **Consult** checked (see §5).  
5. Click **Continue to payment** — Free is **$0** (no card, no pass-token on this page).  
6. Confirmation shows **Handle available, registered** for `{{CONSUMER_ID}}`.

You are a **subscriber of this app** (`consumer_id={{CONSUMER_ID}}`), not a generic store-only account.

---

## 5. Office Hours & Consult add-ons

These are **Free add-ons** (not paid tiers). Uncheck at signup if you do not want them.

| Add-on | What you get | After signup |
|--------|----------------|--------------|
| **Office Hours** | Seat for weekly OH (chat and/or video when host is live) | We send reminders when alerts are enabled · Play → **Meet** |
| **Consult 20m** | Eligibility to book a 20-minute slot | Play → **Book** → choose time on the consult calendar |

Platform rails: community / AMA / OH / consult are on **merit-prod** + provider packs. Your app’s `app_logic/` can extend behavior without forking rails.

Live dogfood of community rails: [community-rails](https://merit-prod.vercel.app/portal/developers/community-rails/).

