## 11. Troubleshooting

| Symptom | Try |
|---------|-----|
| Register 404 | Builder runs `.\merit.ps1 apps refresh --path <repo>` |
| Handle taken | Pick a suggestion — policy blocks never say “NSFW” |
| No OH reminder | Confirm OH was checked; builder enables alerts cfg |
| Want pass-token | Complete Free join first; use app Login when pass-token is enabled |

**Builder refresh (does not touch `app_logic/`):**

```powershell
.\merit.ps1 apps refresh --path ..\{{CONSUMER_ID}}
