## 12. Usage & quotas (builders)

First-party rails (publish, tenant, book, alerts) are **metered** on merit-prod. Members do not see this; builders do.

| If… | Then… |
|-----|--------|
| You want usage graphs | Open `https://merit-prod.vercel.app/apps/{{CONSUMER_ID}}/usage` (Make Art dashboard — not a JSON dump) |
| You want machine JSON | `GET https://merit-prod.vercel.app/api/usage?consumer_id={{CONSUMER_ID}}&format=json` |
| You hit HTTP 429 | Wait the `Retry-After` window (Free: 60 mutating calls / 5 min; 40 publishes / hour) |
| You want to charge overage later | `fee_recipe` is $0 in Alpha; paid cents attach without rewriting `app_logic/` |
| You want a one-line suggestion on play | Set `cfg/usage.json` `one_liners.enabled` to `true` and add `lines[]`. Off by default. Not ads. |

OID-MAN seed. Contract: `cfg/usage.json`.

